$ whycant -u alice write /srv/data.db

✓ alice (uid 1000) can write /srv/data.db

  /              drwxr-xr-x  root:root  ✓ traverse
  /srv           drwxr-xr-x  root:root  ✓ traverse
  /srv/data.db   -rw-rw-rw-  root:root  ! write

Also noticed
  /srv/data.db: filesystem is full
    The filesystem holding / has no free space left for alice, so writes will fail
    with "No space left on device" whatever the permissions.
